      "transcript": [
        {
          "node": "hold.come-to"
        },
        {
          "node": "hold.wake",
          "line": "You're awake. Good. They don't like waking you at the desk, it makes the writing slow."
        },
        {
          "node": "hold.out",
          "line": "The light up there is bad, but it is light. When they have finished writing you down, this is where I will be, if I am anywhere."
        },
        {
          "node": "hold.hatch-name",
          "value": "Marsh-Reed",
          "line": "Marsh-Reed. I will not say it again where they can hear it, and neither will you, and one day a stranger will say it to you and you will know what they are."
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.enter",
          "line": "Stand where the light is. I have to be able to see you to write you down."
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.race-observed",
          "value": "correct"
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.sex",
          "value": "male"
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.upbringing",
          "value": "interior",
          "line": "The interior. I will write the marsh. There are people here who will read that and stand up straighter, and people who will read it and count their doors."
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.given-name",
          "value": "Marsh-Reed",
          "line": "Marsh-Reed. Two hundred and fifty gold at any Provincial Office if you decide you were wrong, once, and the old one stays legible under the line."
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.class-routes",
          "value": "named"
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.class-named",
          "value": "salt-blade",
          "line": "Salt-Blade. Somebody paid you to stand at the front of something."
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.class-verdict",
          "value": "go-on"
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.birthsign",
          "value": "raj-xul",
          "line": "The tide was in and the root had more than it needed. It gave you a swallow it did not owe you."
        },
        {
          "node": "writ.stamp",
          "line": "Marsh-Reed. Saxhleel. interior. Salt-Blade. The Full Root. — Reed-case, stamped, and it is the only thing in this province that says you are a person rather than a shape that was seen. Do not lose it. The door behind me is the one you want. Past it, no one tells you a thing you have not asked for. It is the only part of this province that is free.",
